OL,3,CProgramme listings for WED 8 APR
OL,4,G2200FNight Tracks
OL,5,     GSara Mohr-Pietsch presents an
OL,6,     Gadventurous, immersive soundtrack
OL,7,     Gfor late-night listening, from
OL,8,     Gclassical to contemporary and
OL,9,     Geverything in between.
OL,10,G2330F'Round Midnight
OL,11,     GSoweto Kinch presents more of the
OL,12,     Gbest in jazz from the UK and
OL,13,     Garound the world and shares a
OL,14,     Gswinging release from the late
OL,15,     GEnglish jazz singer Beryl Bryden.
OL,16,G0030FThrough the Night
OL,17,     GNelson Goerner performs Mozart's
OL,18,     GPiano Concerto no 23 with the
OL,19,     GOrchestre de la Suisse Romande,
OL,20,     Gconducted by Jonathan Nott.
OL,21,     GLater, Tchaikovsky's rarely
OL,22,     Gperformed Third Symphony.
